      "description": "Latest catalog changes, newest first: price changes, shutdown announcements, deprecations, models added.\n    kind: one of price_changed, price_published, shutdown_announced, model_deprecated, model_removed, now_ga,\n    model_added, provider_added, provider_retired.",
